bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    seed_jit_erased_f64_option_some_binds_raw_bits_2026-11-27, 0, "Repro (base seed aa542919a298e130 = origin f43f68c218e, release/1.0.0, aarch64, JIT; interpreter correct): val c: f64? = Some(1.5); fn g(x): match x: Some(v): print \"S{v}\" prints S576179277326712832 on the JIT (0x3FF8000000000000 >> 3: the Option payload slot holds raw IEEE bits, read as a tagged int by the untyped binder), interpreter S1.5. Some(0.1) compared v == 0.1 is false; relay(x) -> f64? then ?? also loses the value. The raw form (val b: f64? = 0.1) binds correctly. Split out of parse_family_strips_option_jit_native_2026-08-02 residual (b)."

